<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Fleet</li></ol><p class="kick">The fleet</p><h1>Two lifeboats, a flood boat <em>and a truck</em></h1><p class="lede">Each one was paid for by a gift in a will, a town fundraising drive, a grant or a local business. Launch counts are for 2026.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight" style="padding-bottom:70px"><div class="w"><div class="boats">{% for b in Target.Items %}{%- assign y=b.PublishedContent -%}<a class="boat" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ b.RoutePath }}"><img src="{{ y.art.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="Generated side-profile plate of {{ b.PrimaryField }}" loading="lazy"><div class="b"><span class="lab" style="font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--sig);text-transform:uppercase">{% capture lv1 -%}{{ y.kind }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv1 %}{% when "ilb" %}Inshore lifeboat{% when "flood" %}Flood rescue boat{% when "vehicle" %}Response vehicle{% else %}{{ lv1 }}{% endcase %}</span><h3>{{ b.PrimaryField }}</h3><p>{{ y.summary }}</p><div class="sp"><span><b>{{ y.launches }}</b> launches in 2026</span><span>since {{ y.in_service }}</span></div></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
